This product optionally reads spam rule data published by the Apache
SpamAssassin project (https://spamassassin.apache.org), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. That data is not distributed with this software:
an operator loads it deliberately with "teanode-server config rules import",
and it is used only when antispam.builtin.rules.enabled is set.

The built-in spam filter in this software is a separate implementation. It is
not SpamAssassin, is not derived from its code, and is not compatible with it;
it reads the published rule format and evaluates the subset of it that it
understands.
